/T (Service address validation does not guarantee network coverage. Actual coverage may vary and is subject to change without notice. \(Example: there may not be no coverage if device is used underground\). Service address validation applies to areas within the domestic coverage areas. If the response is no, the user may still be able to get services if domestic roaming is enabled.)
/E (Service address validation does not guarantee network coverage. Actual coverage may vary and is subject to change without notice. \(Example: there may not be no coverage if device is used underground\). Service address validation applies to areas within the domestic coverage areas. If the response is no, the user may still be able to get services if domestic roaming is enabled.)
