<<
/Title (Note that this API validates service address for service activation with downstream carrier and cannot be used as general-purpose address validation. Downstream carriers might validate only portion of service address or ignore mismatches in zone code and postal code. Put another way, successful service address validation does not guarantee that the actual address is valid, rather it means downstream carrier will accept that address for service activation.)
